The Time-of-Flight detector is made of 120 trays utilizing Multigap Resistive Plate Chambers (MRPCs) technology and covers \(2\pi\) in azimuth at \(|\eta|<0.9\) surrounding the TPC OFC[64, 65]. The TOF uses event timing information from the forward Vertex-Position-Detector (VPD), see Fig.2.2, together with track hit timing in the

