\[\epsilon_{matching}=\frac{\beta>0}{\text{no $\beta$ cut}}\]

where \(\beta\) is the track speed from TOF. The cuts listed in Table.3.6 have applied to the denominator and numerator of the TOF-matching efficiency above. Fig.3.26 left plot shows the matching efficiency in closed circles. The right plot in the same figure shows the convolution of TOF matching and eID efficiencies.

